ting the coefficients of $\\operatorname{sin}⁡x$ and $\\operatorname{cos}⁡x,$ we get the following system of equations:\n\n$$\n{\\begin{aligned}R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ=\\sqrt{3} \\\\ R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ=3\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nSquaring the first and the second equations of the system and adding the results together, we get\n\n$$\n\\begin{aligned}{(R\\operatorname{cos}⁡ϕ)}^{2}+{(R\\operatorname{sin}⁡ϕ)}^{2} & =(\\sqrt{3})^{2}+{3}^{2} \\\\ {R}^{2}({cos}^{2}⁡ϕ+{sin}^{2}⁡ϕ) & =3+9 \\\\ {R}^{2} & =12 \\\\ R & =2\\sqrt{3}.\\end{aligned}\n$$\n\nNote that we only consider the positive root since $R>0.$" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266552 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266553 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266554 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266555 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1000 #edb/ref 17592186266556 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1040 #edb/ref 17592186045450 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1041 "selection" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1104 #edb/ref 17592186266552 13194139533930 true] [17592186266551 1110 #uuid "c5c9a875-3fdd-5ea4-9aca-2861eb449a9e" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266552 1034 "2\\sqrt{3}" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266552 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533930 true] [17592186266552 1111 #uuid "00295e9c-f622-5e51-a7ee-b2097ff85a8f" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266553 1034 "12" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266553 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533930 true] [17592186266553 1111 #uuid "5c747491-7444-568e-ac19-2fecc1eb9bee" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266554 1034 "\\frac{\\sqrt{3}}{3}" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266554 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533930 true] [17592186266554 1111 #uuid "2b788dc0-c61a-5e5b-8d1b-69349143796c" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266555 1034 "6" 13194139533930 true] [17592186266555 1103 #edb/ref 17592186045453 13194139533930 true] [17592186266555 1111 #uuid "839cda